Worker Node 2 > Auto Scaling Group
Worker Node 3 > Auto Scaling Group
OIDC Provider > IRSA Role Load Balancer
OIDC Provider > IRSA Role Autoscaler
OIDC Provider > IRSA Role Metrics
OIDC Provider > IRSA Role EBS
IRSA Role Load Balancer > AWS Load Balancer Controller
IRSA Role Autoscaler > Cluster Autoscaler
IRSA Role Metrics > Metrics Server
IRSA Role EBS > EBS CSI Driver
AWS Load Balancer Controller > Worker Node 1
Cluster Autoscaler > Auto Scaling Group
Metrics Server > Worker Node 1
